msgid "401: the target did not accept the token. With the API of a GLPI: use the \"Password\" grant type in the token provider (a \"Client credentials\" token is linked to no user), and check that the token is present in the headers."
msgstr "401: the target did not accept the token. With the API of a GLPI: use the \"Password\" grant type in the token provider (a \"Client credentials\" token is linked to no user), and check that the token is present in the headers."

msgid "403: the token is valid but not allowed. With the API of a GLPI: add the \"api\" scope to the token provider and to the OAuth client of the target GLPI, and check the rights of the user on the target."
msgstr "403: the token is valid but not allowed. With the API of a GLPI: add the \"api\" scope to the token provider and to the OAuth client of the target GLPI, and check the rights of the user on the target."

