msgstr "Not JSON"

msgid "Not sent yet"
msgstr "Not sent yet"

msgid "Optional. OAuth 2.0 \"scope\" parameter sent with the token request: permissions requested for the token, as defined by the API (e.g. \"api.read api.write\" or \"https://graph.microsoft.com/.default\"). Separate several scopes with spaces. Leave empty if the token server does not require it."
msgstr "Optional. OAuth 2.0 \"scope\" parameter sent with the token request: permissions requested for the token, as defined by the API (e.g. \"api.read api.write\" or \"https://graph.microsoft.com/.default\"). Separate several scopes with spaces. Leave empty if the token server does not require it."

